{"id":"648789","name":"云朵吐司","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/648789/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"柠檬汁（白醋）","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"吐司和鸡蛋备用。","img":"images/648789/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将蛋白和蛋黄分离至容器中。","img":"images/648789/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蛋白加入白砂糖。","img":"images/648789/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将蛋白打发至硬挺。","img":"images/648789/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"烤盘放入吐司，烤箱提前上下火180度预热。","img":"images/648789/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将蛋白霜铺在吐司上。","img":"images/648789/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蛋黄窝在蛋白霜中。","img":"images/648789/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将吐司入烤箱，上下火180度烤10分钟左右。","img":"images/648789/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出炉晾凉即可食用。","img":"images/648789/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648789/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648789/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648789/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}